msgctxt "game_options"
msgid "Set Anti Aliasing for rendered content. A dangerous option to enable in Dolphin. Setting this too high will quickly cause a bandwidth bottleneck on your GPU. Worse yet, these settings may cause various graphical effects in games to be sampled incorrectly."
